<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmación de Reserva - EleStu</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f6f6f6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e9e9e9;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #2c3e50; /* Dark blue/grey, matches a professional look */
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header img {
            max-width: 150px; /* Adjust size as needed */
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 10px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .content h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .details-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .details-table th, .details-table td {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .details-table th {
            background-color: #ecf0f1; /* Light grey */
            color: #555;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 35%; /* Adjust width for labels */
        }
        .details-table td {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 30px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #3498db; /* Blue button */
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9e9e9;
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .contact-info {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .contact-info a {
            color: #3498db;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        {{!-- Replace YOUR_BASE64_IMAGE_DATA_HERE with your actual Base64 encoded EleStu.png data --}}
        {{!-- Example: data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAA... --}}
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,
" alt="EleStu Logo">
        <h1>¡Reserva Confirmada!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hola,</p>
        <p>Tu reserva en <strong>EleStu</strong> ha sido confirmada con éxito. ¡Estamos emocionados de tenerte!</p>

        <h2>Detalles de tu Reserva:</h2>
        <table class="details-table">
            <tr>
                <th>Estudio:</th>
                <td>{{studioName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Fecha:</th>
                <td>{{date}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Hora:</th>
                <td>{{time}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Descripción:</th>
                <td>{{description}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Precio por Hora:</th>
                <td>{{pricePerHour}} €/hora</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p>Recibirás un correo electrónico de seguimiento con más información o si se requiere algo adicional.</p>
        <p>¡Esperamos verte pronto!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="button-container">
        {{!-- You can link to a user dashboard or contact page here --}}
        <a href="http://yourwebsite.com/my-bookings" class="button">Ver mis reservas</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} EleStu. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p>Si tienes alguna pregunta, no dudes en contactarnos:</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:elestu777@gmail.com">elestu777@gmail.com</a> | Teléfono: +34 777 777 777</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>